  // Josiah's fourth canal, in red, where he stopped.
  Thing canal_map "the canal map over the fireplace" at cherrett_parlour {
    Tries looking.
    State hung "On the canal map over the fireplace, one line is drawn in red pencil, and stops.".
  }
  Initially Assert state(canal_map, hung).
  Discovery josiah_line "On Mrs Cherrett's canal map one line is in red pencil: the Lim cut, Josiah's last survey, which would have brought the coal barges up the valley to Hessel, and stops on the down above the town.".
  Observe canal_map_looked near canal_map when tried(canal_map, looking) and not seenOnce(josiah_line) "Three canals in black ink, engraved, with their locks marked like the rungs of ladders: the Delve, the Wem, the Long Navigation. And a fourth, in red pencil, by hand: from the head of the Delve up the Lim valley, through the meadows below the bridge, round the shoulder of the down, and stopping, in a little blot, a mile short of Hessel. Somebody has written beside the blot, in pencil, very small, in a hand that pressed hard: here." teaches josiah_line.
  Initially Assert teachesAt(josiah_line, cherrett_parlour).
  Topic cherrett_red_line with cherrett "Ask Mrs Cherrett about the red line on the canal map" when knows(actor, josiah_line) and not gone(cherrett) and cherrettUp() once {
    Says "Mrs Cherrett does not look at the map. She knows where it is. 'The Lim cut,' she says. 'Coal up the valley at half what the carriers ask, and stone down it, and the chairmen's boys on the barges instead of the poles.' She turns her stick in her hands. 'The Corporation said it would spoil the view from the Crescent. Josiah came up to talk them round, the spring of the Great Snow, and walked the line himself, in the wet, with that compass, and took a chill on the down, and was dead in a fortnight in the Two Poles, in the back room.' She laughs, not the coal-scuttle laugh. 'He'd marked the place he stopped. Here, he wrote. I've never known if he meant here's where the cut stops, or here's where I do.' A pause. 'That's why I come to Hessel. Not the waters. The waters are muck.'".
    On discuss { Increase softened(cherrett) by 1. }
  }
